		{
			description: [
				"Welcome to the Book of John!"
				"(full title: Gallows Humor 2: The Book of John)"
				""
				"This modpack is designed to be a maximalist horror sandbox! An adventure pack without the usual Terraria-progression baggage! Your goal is just to exist in the world and make progress however you see fit. There should be an endless amount of ways to spend your time should you seek them out."
				""
				"It won't be easy, but it won't be a slog either. Hopefully."
			]
			id: "10BB1B744376F9BB"
			rewards: [{
				count: 2
				id: "6EFAAEDD3825FF0D"
				item: "legendarysurvivaloverhaul:plaster"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "the witching hour"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7AC145EF29EDE341"
				title: "An Introduction"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			x: 0.0d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["10BB1B744376F9BB"]
			description: [
				"This modpack is largely defined by its expansive and often brutal cast of creatures. Darkness is unforgiving, and crawling with bloodthirsty renegades waiting for a foolish traveler to waltz into their line of sight. Wise survivors will take advantage of lengthy daylight hours, especially since passing the night will require more effort than simply owning a bed."
				""
				"Caves are greatly expanded as well, with a wide range of sights to see, treasures to find, and monsters to fear. Torches will be more vital than ever."
			]
			icon: "cavesanddepths:soul_copper_lantern"
			id: "734865FB5E0ECA85"
			rewards: [{
				id: "6E1C2F2E24A128D4"
				item: "legendarysurvivaloverhaul:plaster"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "bump in the night"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5A1130F241B3BC2B"
				title: "What Lurks Beneath"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			x: 0.0d
			y: -1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["10BB1B744376F9BB"]
			description: [
				"Your items will remain with you even after your own death. However, you will pay in other ways. These consequences can be undone, but not without a deal of effort. Shards of life force can be looted from the remains of:"
				""
				"-John, and his offspring"
				"-the perpetual soldiers, who wear the skin of travelers before you"
				"-benevolent collectors of all that glitters"
				"-she who dwells beneath the stone and dirt"
				"-the song of the swamp"
			]
