		{
			dependencies: ["10BB1B744376F9BB"]
			description: [
				"This book is written non-linearly, so that it does not take away from the sandbox laid out before you. Rifling through its chapters may be a good way to pass the time on a particularly lonely night."
				""
				"ANGELS GUIDE ME: for seeking guidance, and possibly more "
				""
				"THE YEARNING: for cataloguing expeditions to worlds beyond your own"
				""
				"TARRARE'S TOUCH: for the curious chef, who's talents will prove necessary for survival"
				""
				"GNASHING OF TEETH: for slaying even the most vicious of enemies"
				""
				"RENAISSANCE MAN: for objectives that do not fit within the other chapters"
				""
				"and the _______ ______, for the impatient traveler"
			]
